+// These defaults widen the bounded normal-mode budget to 5 s -> 60 s with 20%
+// jitter (5s,10s,20s,40s,60s) which is what actually rides out a 429. Override
+// per profile via plugin config `retryPolicy` or $DSH_ANTIGRAVITY_RETRY_POLICY.
